<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Costello looks to Australia CPI success.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Costello looks to Australia CPI success.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello told government members of parliament on Tuesday the government's campaign for price and wage restraint would be successful.</p>
<p>&quot;Generally, we could look to the success of our policy in relation to inflation and wages,&quot; a Liberal Party spokesman told reporters, quoting Costello.  </p>
<p>Australia's annual inflation rate eased to 2.1 percent in the September quarter from 3.1 percent in the previous quarter.</p>
<p>-- Canberra Bureau 61-6 273-2730</p>
</text>
